### Describe the bug

Roundtripping an AST containing the code below, the output contains `-Infinity` instead of `-1e999`. I think the output should remain as `-1e999`.

### Input code

```typescript
const x = -1e999;
```


### Config

```json
{
  "jsc": {
    "parser": {
      "syntax": "typescript",
      "tsx": false
    },
    "target": "es2022",
    "loose": false,
    "minify": {
      "compress": false,
      "mangle": false
    },
    "transform": {
      "react": {
        "importSource": "npm:react",
        "runtime": "automatic"
      }
    }
  },
  "module": {
    "type": "es6"
  },
  "minify": false,
  "isModule": true
}
```


